# Operator path self-certification

`OPERATOR_PATH_SELF_CERTIFIED = YES|NO`

No operator OAuth / click-path instructions when **NO**.

Before any operator-only Google/Meta/etc step, Cursor must certify what it controls: route · requested scopes · incremental merge · callback · vault persistence · identity retention · capability derivation · Settings UI · Certification UI · reload · restart.

Use fixtures/mocks. Simulate READONLY → UPGRADE → CALLBACK → STORE → RELOAD → BOTH UIS AGREE (×N).

After the operator completes the one external step, Cursor inspects the real credential immediately. On failure Cursor diagnoses — the operator does not retry blindly.

The operator is never the first tester.